<title>SLOVAKIA: Bratislava bourse closed for Easter holiday.</title>
<headline>Bratislava bourse closed for Easter holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bratislava Stock Exchange (BSE) did not trade on Friday and will remain closed until April 1 as the country observes the Easter holiday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the BSE's SAX index firmed 0.18 points to 207.02.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
